        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: به همین دلیل",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "به همین دلیل (be hamin dalil) — \"for this reason, that is why\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "کارش را دوست نداشت، به همین دلیل دنبال یک کار تازه است. kârash râ dust nadâsht, be hamin dalil donbâl-e yek kâr-e tâze ast. He did not like his job; that is why he is looking for a new one."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Be + hamin \"this very\" + dalil \"reason\". It opens a clause that states a result."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "به همین دلیل (be hamin dalil) joins the native words be \"to\" and hamin \"this very\" to dalil, from Arabic dalīl (EtymDB): for this very reason."
            }
          ]
        },
