          "title": "You'll want to know: لذا",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "لذا (lezâ) — \"therefore (formal)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "هوا خیلی بد بود، لذا جلسه برگزار نشد. havâ kheyli bad bud, lezâ jalase bargozâr nashod. The weather was very bad; therefore the meeting was not held."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Formal and written; in speech barâye hamin. A whole clause follows. ذ sounds like z."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "لذا (lezâ) is usually traced to the Arabic phrase li-dhā \"for this\"; Persian says the Arabic dh as z."
            }
          ]
        },
