            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "با توجه به قیمت، این ماشین خوب است. bâ tavajjoh be qeymat, in mâshin khub ast. Considering the price, this car is good."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Bâ \"with\" + tavajjoh \"attention\" + be \"to\". It takes a noun; with a clause, bâ tavajjoh be inke …."
